>
>
>
> > Hi,
> > does R/qtl prepare a linkage map from scratch?
> > Using est.rf I could estimate the recombination fraction of the
> > markers.However I can't see any function that use the Haldane or the
> > Kosambi functions...
> > Am I missing anything ?
> > cheers
> > mc
